WEBVTT

00:05:59.641 --> 00:06:02.776
Luckily, such a thing exists,

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.124
and it's called a chemolithoautotroph.

00:06:05.148 --> 00:06:06.156
(Laughter)

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:10.204
Which is a microbe
that uses chemicals -- "chemo,"

00:06:10.228 --> 00:06:12.458
from rocks -- "litho,"

00:06:12.482 --> 00:06:15.244
to make food -- "autotroph."

00:06:15.268 --> 00:06:17.926
And they can do this
with a ton of different elements.

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:21.783
They can do this with sulphur,
iron, manganese, nitrogen, carbon,

00:06:21.807 --> 00:06:25.037
some of them can use
pure electrons, straight up.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.942
Like, if you cut the end
off of an electrical cord,

00:06:27.966 --> 00:06:29.875
they could breathe it like a snorkel.

00:06:29.899 --> 00:06:31.211
(Laughter)